{"reply":"Unfortunately, once an order has been processed and shipped, we can't make changes to the shipping address. However, if your order hasn't shipped yet, you can contact our customer support team and we'll do our best to assist you with updating the address.

If you'd like to update your shipping address before we ship your order, please let us know as soon as possible so we can make the necessary changes. Please note that any changes made after an order has shipped will require a return of the item(s) and then re-shipment from our warehouse.

Would you like me to help you with updating your shipping address or would you like more information on returns and refunds?","blocked_by":null}
